{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301301","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301301","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1830130101:1":{"text":"Where did that explosion come from? Was there a bomb planted underground? The whole Syndicate building collapsed!","source_cn":"商会楼下是埋了颗炸弹吗，为什么会突然爆炸？整栋大楼都塌了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF418D578375F82D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830130102:1":{"text":"Who cares? We made it out, and that's what matters! I'm not ready to become a Graveborn yet!","source_cn":"管他呢……反正咱们逃出来了！我可还不想变成亡灵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17449ABBD3301CAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830130103:1":{"text":"Do we still have to work tomorrow?","source_cn":"那明天还上班吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC9C58222B6740F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830130104:1":{"text":"Work? Where? The whole office is gone!","source_cn":"上什么班？工位都没了，你还要去哪上班？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x641B296D21650035","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830130105:1":{"text":"That's what I wanted to hear! Another drink for me, please!","source_cn":"太棒了！我等的就是这句话！老板，再来一杯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x764F161E59F450D0","variant